  "description": {
    "text": "The 2024 Pokémon World Championships, held from 16 to 18 August 2024 at the Hawai'i Convention Center in Honolulu. Competitors got Paradise Resort with new art by Naoki Saito, a surfing Pikachu among other Pokémon, while supplies lasted; staff got a Staff copy, and top finishers copies stamped with their placing.\n\nThe top four of each age division received No. 1 to No. 4 Trainer trophy cards, whose text now tells the winner they may proclaim themselves one of the top Pokémon Trainers in the world.",
